--- !u!114 &6763281046615271421
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2972158262887172800}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8222b13549041bb4b9a46564726299a8, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialog:
    lines:
    - Oh hello, you must be the newbie!
    - I've heard all about you, we're lucky to have you!
    - I'd love to help you get started, but it seems that I misplaced my glasses.
    - Could you help me find them?
    - I remember having them while reading under the apple tree.
    - The apple tree? Oh it's in the park, down to the right of here.
    - Thanks a bunch!
  InteractPrompt: {fileID: 763465968971152322}
  seen: 0
  showTravelChoice: 0
  travelChoices: []
  minigameChoices:
  - Play Cards
  - Talk
  yesChoiceInt: 0
  cantaffordtravelDialog:
    lines: []
--- !u!114 &4578145239934903075
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2972158262887172800}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b6d015f7e12d4724faaff1d65c54e3d0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogEntries:
  - itemName: ShepardsGlasses
    dialog:
      lines:
      - Oh?
      - You found my glasses? Splendid!
      - Wait, I just remembered I left my supplies at the beach.
      - I'm such a klutz!
      - It wouldn't be too much to ask your help again would it?
      - The beach is directly south from the hospital.
  - itemName: MedicalSupplies
    dialog:
      lines:
      - Have you retrieved my supplies? Wonderful!
      - You've already been such outstanding help!
      - Now I think we can finally head inside...
      - ...huh...wait...what? My ID card!!!
      - They won't know who I am!! I can't go inside!!
      - I keep bringing shame upon my name.
      - It probably slipped out of my pocket while I was playing the piano.
      - What's that you ask? Why yes I love playing music and it's what I often do
        in my free time.
      - The music room is in the basement of the hospital.
      - I warn you though, it is very messy down there.
  - itemName: IDCard
    dialog:
      lines:
      - Ah I see you found my ID card!
      - Now we can finally enter the building.
      - But first, I want to stop by the post office and pick up my mail.
      - It is quite a distance though, and I need to conserve my energy for my patients.
      - If only there was a young, energetic person who could do it for me...
      - ...
      - ...
      - ...
      - ...Ah yes you lad, how convenient of you to be here in my time of need!.
      - I need to send my niece her birthday card, can you drop it off for me?
      - The post office is in the town you passed by when first arriving here.
      - You're the best!
